dding: 0px; user-select: text;"> </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW117067265 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">In transdisciplinary education, however, assessment brings </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW117067265 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">additional</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW117067265 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW117067265 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">challenges, because</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW117067265 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> learning is highly </span></span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW117067265 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">unpredictable</span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW117067265 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">, </span><span data-contrast="auto" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW117067265 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0